==English==

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|la}} {{term|sine||without|lang=la}} + {{term|die|diē|lang=la}}, the {{ablative}} {{singular}} of {{term|dies|diēs|a day|lang=la}}. Literally meaning "without a day".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/saɪnɪ daɪiː/}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# [[without]] [[specifying]] a [[date]] (for a [[future]] [[event]]); [[indefinitely]]

